---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="포트폴리오" active="portfolio">
  <header class="page-intro"><h1>포트폴리오</h1></header>
  <ul class="portfolio-links" aria-label="포트폴리오 목록">
    <li><a class="recruitment-entry" href="/portfolio/2027/">
      <div><h2>DCB 프로젝트</h2><p>DCB의 핵심 구현과 AI 협업, 담당 범위와 검증 내용을 모았습니다.</p></div>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a></li>
    <li><a class="recruitment-entry" href="/portfolio/unreal-porting/">
      <div><h2>언리얼 엔진 포팅</h2><p>Unity의 DCB를 AI와 함께 언리얼 엔진으로 옮기는 프로젝트입니다. 포팅한 기능과 현재 진행 중인 작업을 소개합니다.</p></div>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a></li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .portfolio-links { display: grid; gap: 16px; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .recruitment-entry { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding: 20px 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; background: #eaf0e6; color: var(--green); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: -.4px; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .recruitment-entry h2 { margin: 0 0 7px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .recruitment-entry p { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: normal; }
  .recruitment-entry > span:last-child { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .recruitment-entry:hover h2 { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .recruitment-entry { padding: 18px; gap: 16px; } .recruitment-entry h2 { font-size: 16px; } }
</style>
